  START --> RULE_BR045
  RULE_BR045 --> DEC_FUNC
  DEC_FUNC -->|when 'CONN'| RULE_BR046
  RULE_BR046 --> LOOP_CONN
  LOOP_CONN -->|no — continue| IO_CONNECT
  IO_CONNECT --> DEC_SQL
  DEC_SQL -->|yes / true| SET_CONN
  DEC_SQL -->|no / false| PARA_1100
  SET_CONN --> DEC_WAIT
  PARA_1100 --> DEC_WAIT
  DEC_WAIT -.->|? call DELAY — not in registry| CALL_DELAY
  DEC_WAIT -.->|uncertain: repeat| LOOP_CONN
  LOOP_CONN -->|yes — done| TERMINAL
  DEC_FUNC -->|when 'DISC'| RULE_BR048
  RULE_BR048 --> DEC_CONNECTED
  DEC_CONNECTED -->|yes / true| IO_DISC
  DEC_CONNECTED -->|no / false| TERMINAL
  IO_DISC --> TERMINAL
  DEC_FUNC -->|when 'STAT'| IO_STAT
  IO_STAT --> DEC_STAT
  DEC_STAT -->|yes — return code 0| TERMINAL
  DEC_STAT -->|no — return code 4| TERMINAL
  DEC_FUNC -->|other| CALL_ERRPROC
  CALL_ERRPROC --> TERMINAL

